:0b2ee9c70b31192a48c55181adbbf792cf6724cd a :Conflict ;
    :ConflictDescription "<p>Palliative care has a relatively short history, oncologists have been around for more than 30 years. We have gotten used to having these kind of patients’ problems like pain for a long time before this redundant specialty of palliative care was created.</p>" ;
    :ConflictState "open" ;
    :ConflictTitle "Professional expertise" ;
    :CreationDate "2025-05-21T15:57:37.714Z" ;
    :HasParticipant :Delivering_Care,
        :Hierarchy,
        :Hospital ;
    :WrittenBy "Oncologist" .

:69f9ecba2e9ab176efcc3b5044ea322a7a029443 a :Conflict ;
    :ConflictDescription "<p>I am a specialist and therefore I am here to take care of the patient until death, I will take care of him. I will not ask for the intervention of the PC specialist because I am able to face these situations anyway. When we are able to treat the disease… imagine if we are not able to palliate the symptoms…!</p>" ;
    :ConflictState "open" ;
    :ConflictTitle "Professional expertise" ;
    :CreationDate "2025-05-21T16:00:54.069Z" ;
    :HasParticipant :Conviction,
        :Delivering_Care,
        :Oncologist,
        :Palliative_physician ;
    :WrittenBy "Oncologist" .

